:05Z","body":"Thanks for the response! I think alternatively you could do:\n\n``` java\nif (!isUnsubscribed() && (count++ < limit)) {\n    boolean stop = count >= limit;\n    child.onNext(i);\n    if (stop && !completed) {\n        completed = true;\n        try {\n            child.onCompleted();\n        } finally {\n            unsubscribe();\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\nWhich only changes the outer conditional and the computation of `stop`. LMK if that sounds good and I'll prepare a PR?\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ReactiveX/RxJava/issues/comments/140545664/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"mgp","id":489948,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4OTk0OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/489948?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgp","html_url":"https://github.com/mgp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ReactiveX/RxJava/issues/comments/140550504","html_url":"https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/issues/3346#issuecomment-140550504","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ReactiveX/RxJava/issues/3346","id":140550504,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE0MDU1MDUwNA==","user":{"login":"akarnokd","id":1269832,"no